{
  "comment": "R1 #6 beta trade-off, IEMOCAP. Models pre-trained on SimVowels (the Fig 5h frame-branch results) and on TIMIT, evaluated on the same set as the paper (train + validation + test). Model arguments are those of the checkpoints (config_finetune_iemocap_NoC4.json): from SimVowels z 48, s 24, NoC_seq 4, project_OCs, 6 S-attention heads; from TIMIT the base config values (z 64, s 32, NoC_seq 5). checkpoint_dir bypasses the folder naming of latents_post_analysis.py. SET every path.",
